        "visibility": "public",
        "details": "<p><strong>InnovalQ Technologies is hiring for Python Developer</strong></p>\n<p><strong>About the Company</strong></p>\n<p>InnovalQ Technologies builds practical technology solutions that help teams create impactful digital products. We offer a collaborative environment where developers can work on meaningful applications, strengthen their engineering skills, and grow alongside experienced professionals.</p>\n<p><strong>Responsibilities</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Design, develop, test, and maintain reliable applications using Python.</li>\n<li>Build and enhance backend services and APIs using frameworks such as Django, Flask, or FastAPI.</li>\n<li>Work with databases, Git, and RESTful integrations to deliver maintainable software.</li>\n<li>Participate in troubleshooting, code reviews, documentation, and continuous improvement of development practices.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with team members to understand requirements and deliver solutions within agreed timelines.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong knowledge of Python and sound programming fundamentals.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with REST APIs, databases, version control, and software development workflows.</li>\n<li>Strong problem-solving, analytical, and communication skills.</li>\n<li>Experience with Django, Flask, or FastAPI is an advantage.</li>\n<li>Applicants with 0&ndash;3 years of experience are welcome, including freshers with strong Python skills.</li>\n<li>Willingness to learn, take ownership, and contribute in a collaborative work environment.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This is a full-time, in-office opportunity based in Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu, offering an annual compensation range of \u20b910,00,000 to \u20b915,00,000.</p>",
